{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54166","headline":"杂言 · 张孜","name":"杂言","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"只爱轻与肥，不忧贫与贱。\n着牙卖朱紫，断钱賖举选。\n（均见何光远《监诫录》卷九）（〖1〗《监戒录》云：「又驾在蜀日，孜着杂言数百篇，伤时颇切，其一首两联云〖略〗。\n」前二句，《全唐诗》卷六百七已据《唐诗纪事》收入。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张孜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54166.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54166","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}